    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "The `to_strip` parameter here is expected to only be a `str` type. Calling `cudf.Scalar(to_strip)` when `to_strip` is a list is later incorrectly converting a list-scalar into a `string_scalar`. I think the right behavior is to throw a TypeError instead of what Pandas does.",
